OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry
OL,6,Ffor a time this evening with clear
OL,7,Fspells, before a few more showers move
OL,8,Fin from the west overnight. These
OL,9,Fshowers mostly light. A cool night for
OL,10,Fsome.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FSome bright spells for a
OL,13,Fwhile. However, heavy thundery showers
OL,14,Fmove southwards through the morning
OL,15,Fand into the afternoon. Showers
OL,16,Fturning a little lighter later on.
OL,17,FCooler than Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
